tchi/images/d/d7/Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20251007164930","caption":"Карта Теншичи Тамагочи No 9 (Фронт)","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d7/Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20251007164930"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9_(Back).jpeg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c2/Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9_%28Back%29.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20251007165021","caption":"Tenshitchi Tamagotchi Card No 9 (назад)","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c2/Tenshitchi_Tamagotchi_Card_9_%28Back%29.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20251007165021"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/b6/b6c7bb93c1c6911c1702.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:SNESchars.png","caption":"Игра «Налево или направо»","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ShogunAngel_anim_original.gif","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/39/ShogunAngel_anim_original.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241210032043","caption":"Анимированный спрайт (Tamagotchi Angel)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Angel_Balloons_Uni_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/67/Angel_Balloons_Uni_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20240702175045","caption":"Аксессуар Angel Balloons (Уни)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:QCHAR.BIN(1581)_p00.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/ce/QCHAR.BIN%281581%29_p00.png/revision/latest?cb=20210205003351","caption":"Из альбома «Shogun Angel» · № 23"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ShogunAngel_sprite_SNES.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/82/ShogunAngel_sprite_SNES.png/revision/latest?cb=20160211031009","caption":"Спрайт внешнего мира из города Tamagotchi (игра SFC)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Otonoten_ttbio.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bf/Otonoten_ttbio.png/revision/latest?cb=20180611195233","caption":"Спрайт профиля из Tamagotchi Town (SFC Game)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ShogunAngelSprite_App1.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8d/ShogunAngelSprite_App1.png/revision/latest?cb=20140404033016","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Shogun Angel","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ShogunAngelSprite_App2.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/35/ShogunAngelSprite_App2.png/revision/latest?cb=20140404033046","caption":"Альтернативный спрайт 1 из Tamagotchi L.i.f.e.","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ShogunAngelSprite_App3.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d7/ShogunAngelSprite_App3.png/revision/latest?cb=20140404033057","caption":"Альтернативный спрайт 2 из Tamagotchi L.i.f.e.","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/8f/8faccbf48b11daa9a4f3.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gashapon_Tamagotchi_Sticks_Together_8_Character.jpg","caption":"Наклейки гачапон"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:AngelCybies.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/19/AngelCybies.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20140310151814","caption":"Киби плюшевые","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/19/AngelCybies.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140310151814"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:ShogunAngel_2024_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/fb/ShogunAngel_2024_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250529145710","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Shogun Angel","sprite":true}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-angel-f944e3","title":"Tamagotchi Angel","ru":"Tamagotchi Angel",